@baseUrl = http://localhost:5080

### Create a fictional application (use returned id in requests below)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/applications
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "company": "Example Software",
  "role": "C# Backend Developer",
  "appliedOn": "2020-01-01"
}

### Browse applications
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/applications?page=1&pageSize=20

### Move application 1 to Interviewing
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/applications/1/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "Interviewing",
  "expectedVersion": 1
}

### Stale version: expect 409
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/applications/1/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "Offer",
  "expectedVersion": 1
}

### Filter by status
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/applications?status=Interviewing&page=1&pageSize=20

### Health endpoint (process liveness only)
GET {{baseUrl}}/health
